    "warranty": "NOT confirmed for residential air-to-air splits. Daikin UK installer warranty page: standard commercial warranty 'typically 1 or 3 years depending on product type'; Daikin UK Certified Installers 'up to 5 years on AC equipment'; D1/D1+ partners 'up to 7 years on AC equipment' (exact terms behind the Daikin Partner Portal). Daikin UK residential Stand By Me pages describe a free 2 -> 5 year extension when the installer registers the install, but that text is written for air-to-water heat pumps; the July 2025 residential end-user policy (third-party hosted copy) says installer registers on Stand By Me within 90 days of commissioning, customer activates within 24 months, annual maintenance required. UK retailer claims vary: some list Daikin splits with a '3 years manufacturer's parts warranty' (e.g. Rimy, FTXF35E/RXF35E), but Air Conditioning World lists FTXM25R/RXM25R9 with a 5-year manufacturer parts warranty (https://www.airconditioningworld.co.uk/daikin-ftxm25r-rxm25r9-2-5kw-, search extract recorded in docs/research/data/equipment-prices.json, not live-verified). Confirm the air-to-air terms and the Certified Installer route with Daikin UK before quoting customers.",
